From b2e9d5d59a522e353934768d0f9ad0cc002efb29 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: maolo80 <maolo80@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 13:40:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] TeknoNaomi: work with TPUI 1.0.0.2267 profiles; add
 presentation options

Official profiles from TPUI 1.0.0.2267 (TeknoNaomi 0.1.0.16) drop
TeknoNaomiControl, so the saved-binding export found no destination for
any analog control and every analog Naomi game failed to launch. The
routes of the 349 stock profiles are now built in
(TeknoNaomiControlCatalog) and used when a profile has none.

TeknoNaomi 0.1.0.16 adds --presentation-filter, --crt and --bezels. They
are offered under the official field names and values: Presentation
Filter (default ssaa), CRT Shader (None, Lottes, Lottes Downsample) and
Use Bezel. With ssaa and no CRT shader, Auto resolution doubles the
display-fit scale (8 at 2160p), since ssaa averages the extra pixels.

The official Region, Outputs and Use Keyboard/Button For Axis fields have
no launch handling here, so Normalize removes them instead of showing
settings that do nothing. Cabinet Outputs no longer claims force
feedback: the runner's --outputs now carries lamps and recoil only.

Release checks (5119) export the bindings of all 349 profiles with
TeknoNaomiControl removed and require the stock result.

